Z||000015||Tigger||04-04-2001||02:36 PM||||Click the history button, just below post it.  Now, click the thumbnail image of the picture and the code shows up in the line at the bottom of the dialog (you should see your filename at the end of the url and img tags).  Highlight it, copy, and paste it here.  I never tried the ctrl-v, but I think it works after you click the image in the pip history.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 04-04-2001).]||||reg||1
