Z||000019||Kelvin Vivian||04-04-2001||06:39 PM||||Firstfiero wrote "Shes nothing special...but she's mine!"<P>She's special indeed. 1 of 2474 87 SE V6s made. So she's a rare bird. Moreover in 1987, the headlight motors were upgraded, the gas tank was increased from 10.2 to 11.9, the V6 has the engraved Fiero plenum, if the car is a stick then you have the 5-spd Getrag, and the color Medium Red Metallic was first introduced in 1987.<P>I like the way it looks with the hard top and spoiler. Sleek and very clean. Post more pictures when you get the chance. Looks like you figured it out...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||1
